Package: packageflow
Version: @VERSION@-@REVISION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: PackageFlow <packageflow@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, systemd
Recommends: gir1.2-webkit2-4.1, zenity, xvfb, gnome-shell-extension-appindicator | plasma-workspace | xfce4-statusnotifier-plugin
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Description: PackageFlow — library and installation service for PS4/PS5
 Runs the PackageFlow WEB server as a systemd user service with a tray icon
 and an application window. Includes the verified console bundle
 (PS5 service @ELF@, PS5 app @APP@, PS4 service @PS4@) and Node.js @NODE@.
